<section  class="ga-content-block stacking-slide light-purple-section-background-color paragraphsection">
	<div class="paragraph alignwide container meta-info-top">

		
	</div>

	<div class="paragraph alignwide container">

		<div class="row">

			
				<p><p dir="ltr"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">The 2026 U.S. midterm elections are less than a month away. U.S. citizens abroad can register and request a ballot online in minutes, and most can get their ballot electronically.  <b>Send a new Federal Post Card Application (FPCA) each year to keep voting from overseas.</b></span></p>
<ol dir="ltr" start="1">
<li dir="ltr"><span role="presentation"><b>Register and request your ballot:</b>  Visit </span><span role="presentation"><a title="Original URL: https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fvap.gov%2Fcitizen-voter%2Foverview/1/010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000/lEOarReI8bUYc8vfZKM7eiU-uRIdkHThAAXzIy0Qjpw=452. Click or tap if you trust this link." href="https://mcas-proxyweb.mcas-gov.ms/certificate-checker?login=false&amp;originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com.mcas-gov.ms%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fwww.fvap.gov%25252Fcitizen-voter%25252Foverview%252F1%252F010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000%252FlEOarReI8bUYc8vfZKM7eiU-uRIdkHThAAXzIy0Qjpw%253D452%26data%3D05%257C02%257CTravnikovaMO%2540state.gov%257C54e2f58ce86846cc0d7e08df2a8a20a0%257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%257C0%257C0%257C639276444873117185%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DrNnxMMWh15Ldv28KhXFrqnUtMMKZIF%252FABWYq%252BrAXmI8%253D%26reserved%3D0%26McasTsid%3D20893&amp;McasCSRF=390b636438161eea12b9bb68d3394416e1ad7c70461daa701e92a55f744c8dd7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="0"><u>FVAP.gov</u></a></span><span role="presentation"> to register to vote and request your absentee ballot. Deadlines vary by state, so act now.</span></li>
<li dir="ltr"><span role="presentation"><b>Haven&#8217;t received your ballot yet?</b> The midterm elections are on Tuesday, November 3. If you have requested an absentee ballot but haven&#8217;t received it, you can use the </span><span role="presentation"><a title="Original URL: https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fvap.gov%2Ffwab-privacy-notice/1/010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000/p453zRpsB1CtFjcIlgGaECV1FnYWPnDMh5t7rnMQ75Y=452. Click or tap if you trust this link." href="https://mcas-proxyweb.mcas-gov.ms/certificate-checker?login=false&amp;originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com.mcas-gov.ms%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fwww.fvap.gov%25252Ffwab-privacy-notice%252F1%252F010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000%252Fp453zRpsB1CtFjcIlgGaECV1FnYWPnDMh5t7rnMQ75Y%253D452%26data%3D05%257C02%257CTravnikovaMO%2540state.gov%257C54e2f58ce86846cc0d7e08df2a8a20a0%257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%257C0%257C0%257C639276444873138846%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3D82XUvwDmxMWIy8V7r8OXJ3xJWLc2nnkV62iqqmNuU3I%253D%26reserved%3D0%26McasTsid%3D20893&amp;McasCSRF=390b636438161eea12b9bb68d3394416e1ad7c70461daa701e92a55f744c8dd7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="1"><u>Federal Write-In Absentee Ballot (FWAB)</u></a></span><span role="presentation"> as a backup.  You can find the FWAB at </span><span role="presentation"><a title="Original URL: https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fvap.gov%2Ffwab-privacy-notice/2/010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000/WW-73G72kCMCZpN2-XmisSq_7aDi1mfIGGjiYg5nLL0=452. Click or tap if you trust this link." href="https://mcas-proxyweb.mcas-gov.ms/certificate-checker?login=false&amp;originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com.mcas-gov.ms%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fwww.fvap.gov%25252Ffwab-privacy-notice%252F2%252F010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000%252FWW-73G72kCMCZpN2-XmisSq_7aDi1mfIGGjiYg5nLL0%253D452%26data%3D05%257C02%257CTravnikovaMO%2540state.gov%257C54e2f58ce86846cc0d7e08df2a8a20a0%257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%257C0%257C0%257C639276444873159952%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DXiE1UHY3XItHdkzG2X5Eg9eHB53JmCs2KG4f640dPVE%253D%26reserved%3D0%26McasTsid%3D20893&amp;McasCSRF=390b636438161eea12b9bb68d3394416e1ad7c70461daa701e92a55f744c8dd7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="2"><u>FVAP.gov</u></a></span><span role="presentation">.</span></li>
<li dir="ltr"><span role="presentation"><b>Return your completed and signed ballot.</b></span></li>
<li dir="ltr"><span role="presentation"><b>Check how your state accepts absentee ballots.</b> Some states will allow you to return your ballot electronically, and others require a paper ballot. Follow the instructions that come with your ballot. If your state requires a paper ballot, you can send it by international mail, by commercial courier, or to the U.S. Embassy’s American Citizens Services Unit. You can review your state’s requirements at </span><span role="presentation"><a title="Original URL: https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fvap.gov%2Ffwab-privacy-notice/3/010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000/pnW-5F47qEnSWkf91qzTD0EMv6P3IhaxBhaXZnN030s=452. Click or tap if you trust this link." href="https://mcas-proxyweb.mcas-gov.ms/certificate-checker?login=false&amp;originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com.mcas-gov.ms%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fwww.fvap.gov%25252Ffwab-privacy-notice%252F3%252F010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000%252FpnW-5F47qEnSWkf91qzTD0EMv6P3IhaxBhaXZnN030s%253D452%26data%3D05%257C02%257CTravnikovaMO%2540state.gov%257C54e2f58ce86846cc0d7e08df2a8a20a0%257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%257C0%257C0%257C639276444873180245%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DH0ajlXPBYB1SE7hZNnWtkBIctXlalNG%252FoThHB%252FrpOXE%253D%26reserved%3D0%26McasTsid%3D20893&amp;McasCSRF=390b636438161eea12b9bb68d3394416e1ad7c70461daa701e92a55f744c8dd7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="3"><u>FVAP.gov</u></a></span></li>
<li dir="ltr"><span role="presentation"><b>Use the right envelope to send to the U.S. Embassy.</b>  If you send your sealed ballot to the U.S. Embassy’s American Citizens Services Unit, put it in a postage-paid return envelope or in an envelope with sufficient U.S. postage to reach your local election office. You can get postage-paid instructions at </span><span role="presentation"><a title="Original URL: https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fvap.gov%2Fcitizen-voter%2Foverview/2/010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000/AHqFft-kfE64NS8M1SabUjYLgd7JM8S4HZy0odRHNJ0=452. Click or tap if you trust this link." href="https://mcas-proxyweb.mcas-gov.ms/certificate-checker?login=false&amp;originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com.mcas-gov.ms%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fwww.fvap.gov%25252Fcitizen-voter%25252Foverview%252F2%252F010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000%252FAHqFft-kfE64NS8M1SabUjYLgd7JM8S4HZy0odRHNJ0%253D452%26data%3D05%257C02%257CTravnikovaMO%2540state.gov%257C54e2f58ce86846cc0d7e08df2a8a20a0%257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%257C0%257C0%257C639276444873200265%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DveeipQxbglUbuD81dMYsAFcsOqUCgFuMPYd4dqHXmrk%253D%26reserved%3D0%26McasTsid%3D20893&amp;McasCSRF=390b636438161eea12b9bb68d3394416e1ad7c70461daa701e92a55f744c8dd7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="4"><u>FVAP.gov</u></a></span></li>
<li dir="ltr"><span role="presentation"><b>Meet your deadline. </b>Your vote counts only if your ballot is completed, signed, dated, and received by your election office’s deadline which is listed in each </span><span role="presentation"><a title="Original URL: https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.fvap.gov%2F/1/010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000/bZl0w_zLP9pQT6dWnhMwt6mTjOLGOpaoKIfgfI3InaM=452. Click or tap if you trust this link." href="https://mcas-proxyweb.mcas-gov.ms/certificate-checker?login=false&amp;originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com.mcas-gov.ms%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fwww.fvap.gov%25252F%252F1%252F010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000%252FbZl0w_zLP9pQT6dWnhMwt6mTjOLGOpaoKIfgfI3InaM%253D452%26data%3D05%257C02%257CTravnikovaMO%2540state.gov%257C54e2f58ce86846cc0d7e08df2a8a20a0%257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%257C0%257C0%257C639276444873220532%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3D57z%252FLO%252FO9LXwGnR4A0HFC77ZzE7TqJmemNWTKdmTmz8%253D%26reserved%3D0%26McasTsid%3D20893&amp;McasCSRF=390b636438161eea12b9bb68d3394416e1ad7c70461daa701e92a55f744c8dd7" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="5"><u>state’s webpage</u></a></span><span role="presentation">.</span></li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr"><b>Learn more at the Federal Voting Assistance Program’s (FVAP) website, </b><a title="Original URL: https://links-2.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com%2F%3Furl=https%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com%25252F%25253Furl%253Dhttps%2525253A%2525252F%2525252Fwww.fvap.gov%2525252F%252526data%253D05%2525257C02%2525257CACSWarsaw%25252540state.gov%2525257C258fac2c74474f01f8da08df1fa3b8cf%2525257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%2525257C0%2525257C0%2525257C639264460178692007%2525257CUnknown%2525257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%2525253D%2525253D%2525257C0%2525257C%2525257C%2525257C%252526sdata%253DPXnSbXZTa2P9by%2525252B8kjhfQ8ZZb99XhaAz5U3kSPF15vM%2525253D%252526reserved%253D0%252F1%252F010101a10c946ca8-cd27f8de-173d-4aaf-a2b5-8f1f6f1d726b-000000%252FFfRpB2w687fyKnRLiWnhyFZI9IzJ9N0jSmZRfG2_tBQ%253D452%26data=05%257C02%257COrtizMJ%2540state.gov%257C545aae6ad7364ba0e3c808df23bb59e1%257C66cf50745afe48d1a691a12b2121f44b%257C0%257C0%257C639268959710120579%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata=5mRVtI%252BDjkdxDz0w1IfDx3l7ahqF%252Fr3zMr%252BswdbLaYo%253D%26reserved=0/1/010101a120e71070-093ed551-283d-4b42-8cb3-3ea518583e7a-000000/aJnR7Yea1_KGHY6RO4R1QiMM39FFh4AK0F9ZWPKFi8k=452. Click or tap if you trust this link." href="https://mcas-proxyweb.mcas-gov.ms/certificate-checker?login=false&amp;originalUrl=https%3A%2F%2Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com.mcas-gov.ms%2F%3Furl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%252FCL0%252Fhttps%253A%25252F%25252Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com%25252F%25253Furl%253Dhttps%2525253A%2525252F%2525252Flinks-2.govdelivery.com%2525252FCL0%2525252Fhttps%2525253A%252525252F%252525252Fgcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com%252525252F%252